  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0116_514595df0c40.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{u} \\cos 60^{\\circ}=\\mathrm{v} \\cos 30^{\\circ}$\n$$\nv=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}\n$$"
